th for maintenance.","font_family":"body","text_size":4,"max_width":550},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["theme_text_n7KHpT"]},"pair_accordion_item_Nxd3N4":{"type":"_pair-accordion-item","settings":{"title":"Eco-Friendly","gap":"sm"},"blocks":{"theme_text_DwqDpg":{"type":"theme-text","settings":{"text":"PVC-based product, printed wit h Greenguard Gold cer tified low-VOC inks.","font_family":"body","text_size":4,"max_width":550},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["theme_text_DwqDpg"]},"pair_accordion_item_hYwAW9":{"type":"_pair-accordion-item","settings":{"title":"Finish & Texture","gap":"sm"},"blocks":{"theme_text_WdMKBC":{"type":"theme-text","settings":{"text":"Embossed canvas texture that mimics the look of artist's canvas. Matte finish minimizes glare while enhancing print depth and character.","font_family":"body","text_size":4,"max_width":550},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["theme_text_WdMKBC"]},"pair_accordion_item_fcKEyi":{"type":"_pair-accordion-item","settings":{"title":"Removability","gap":"sm"},"blocks":{"theme_text_jgUwAk":{"type":"theme-text","settings":{"text":"Removable under proper conditions; best results when applied to primed, painted, or smooth wall surfaces. Not intended for long-term repositioning once fully adhered.","font_family":"body","text_size":4,"max_width":550},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["theme_text_jgUwAk"]},"title":{"type":"_pair-title","static":true,"settings":{"alignment":"start","gap":"sm"},"blocks":{"theme_kicker_Dd4RWF":{"type":"theme-kicker","settings":{"kicker":"Peel & Stick Canvas","enable_line":true,"text_size":7},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["theme_kicker_Dd4RWF"]}},"block_order":["pair_accordion_item_RwqE4d","pair_accordion_item_eQyfQC","pair_accordion_item_Nxd3N4","pair_accordion_item_hYwAW9","pair_accordion_item_fcKEyi"]}},"custom_css":[".image__hero__scale img {object-fit: contain;}"],"name":"Pair: Slides & Text","settings":{"order":"slideshow-first","duration":5,"height":"use_image","brick_gutter":0,"borders":false,"bg_color":"#f7f5f4","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"section_pair_slideshow_accordion_gtNgdw":{"type":"section-pair-slideshow-accordion","blocks":{"slideshow":{"type":"_pair-slideshow","static":true,"settings":{},"blocks":{"pair_slideshow_slide_zchYBc":{"type":"_pair-slideshow-slide","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2025-09-02_at_8.41.52_PM.png"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["pair_slideshow_slide_zchYBc"]},"accordion":{"type":"_pair-accordion","static":true,"settings":{"text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":"","font_family":"accent","font_weight":"bold","text_size":4},"blocks":{"pair_accordion_item_FThhEG":{"type":"_pair-accordion-item","settings":{"title":"Application Method","gap":"sm"},"blocks":{"theme_text_gi3CBh":{"type":"theme-text","settings":{"text":"Pre-pasted installation — simply activate with water for quick and easy application. No paste or special tools required. Designed for smooth, primed surfaces. Strippable for clean removal when it's time to refresh.","font_family":"body","text_size":4,"max_width":550},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["theme_text_gi3CBh"]},"pair_accordion_item_HVNayH":{"type":"_pair-accordion-item","settings":{"title":"Durability & Cleanability","gap":"sm"},"blocks":{"theme_text_NPX7yj":{"type":"theme-text","settings":{"text":"Best suited for residential interiors, this wallpaper is designed forlong-lasting color and easy upkeep. While not intended for high-traffic commercial spaces, it performs beautifully in homes and canbe gently cleaned with just water and a sponge.","font_family":"body","text_size":4,"max_width":550},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["theme_text_NPX7yj"]},"pair_accordion_item_TYNHYV":{"type":"_pair-accordion-item","settings":{"title":"Eco-Friendly","gap":"sm"},"blocks":{"theme_text_UWaXJy":{"type":"theme-text","settings":{"text":"FSC®-certified, PVC-free paper made with 10% post-consumer recycled content. Printed with Greenguard Gold certified inks.Meets AgBB criteria for VOC safety and carries the CE mark.","font_family":"body","text_size":4,"max_width":550},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["theme_text_UWaXJy"]},"pair_accordion_item_kG8aE6":{"type":"_pair-accordion-item","settings":{"title":"Finish & Texture","gap":"sm"},"blocks":{"theme_text_pdcERg":{"type":"theme-text","settings":{"text":"Ultra-smooth matte finish for vivid color, high-definition image reproduction, and a refined look suitable for residential interiors.","font_family":"body","text_size":4,"max_width":550},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["theme_text_pdcERg"]},"pair_accordion_item_NU3hEY":{"type":"_pair-accordion-item","settings":{"title":"Removability","gap":"sm"},"blocks":{"theme_text_c7LFG8":{"type":"theme-text","settings":{"text":"Strippable under proper conditions; and designed for easy removal with water, leaving minimal residue that wipes clean.","font_family":"body","text_size":4,"max_width":550},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["theme_text_c7LFG8"]},"title":{"type":"_pair-title","static":true,"settings":{"alignment":"start","gap":"sm"},"blocks":{"theme_kicker_mQ3wjf":{"type":"theme-kicker","settings":{"kicker":"Pre Pasted Wallpaper","enable_line":true,"text_size":7},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["theme_kicker_mQ3wjf"]}},"block_order":["pair_accordion_item_FThhEG","pair_accordion_item_HVNayH","pair_accordion_item_TYNHYV","pair_accordion_item_kG8aE6","pair_accordion_item_NU3hEY"]}},"custom_css":[".image__hero__scale img {object-fit: contain;}"],"name":"Pair: Slides & Text","settings":{"order":"slideshow-first","duration":5,"height":"use_image","brick_gutter":0,"borders":false,"bg_color":"","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"section_text_spotlight_8B7cRd":{"type":"section-text-spotlight","blocks":{"spotlight_autohighlight_text_zAPW4t":{"type":"_spotlight-autohighlight-text","settings":{"text":"Frequently Asked Questions","break_newline":false,"highlight_color":"#eeeeee","highlight_appearance":"full"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["spotlight_autohighlight_text_zAPW4t"],"name":"Spotlight Text","settings":{"align_text":"text-left","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","text_size":8,"font_family":"heading","enable_scroll_animation":true,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":90,"padding_bottom":0}},"section_faq_qY6NpW":{"type":"section-faq","blocks":{"text_4bxz7Y":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"What types of wallpaper materials do you offer?","content":"<p>We offer a range of materials to fit both residential and commercial needs, including Peel & Stick Linen, Peel & Stick Canvas, Pre-Pasted Wallpaper, Suede Type II 20oz, and Terralon Smooth Type II. Peel & Stick options are great for DIY projects, Pre-Pasted is ideal for easy installation, and our Type II materials are designed for long-lasting durability in high-traffic commercial spaces.<br\/><br\/><a href=\"\/materials\" title=\"Our Materials\">Click here for more information about our materials.<\/a><\/p>"}},"text_dhMf9q":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Can I order a custom wallpaper design or use my own artwork?","content":"<p>Yes. You can choose from our curated pattern library or upload your own design, photo, or artwork. We’ll ensure your file is print-ready and scaled to fit your wall perfectly, giving you complete creative freedom.<\/p>"}},"text_YzitRa":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"How do you ensure the wallpaper fits my wall perfectly?","content":"<p>Simply measure the full width and height of each wall, including doors and windows. Our ordering system allows you to input exact dimensions, and we provide installation guides to ensure a seamless fit with minimal waste.<\/p>"}},"text_J97hME":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Are the wallpapers durable and easy to maintain?","content":"<p>Yes. Our commercial-grade materials are designed to withstand heavy use, while our residential wallpapers are washable and scuff-resistant. Most surfaces can be gently cleaned with a damp sponge or soft cloth, making maintenance simple.<\/p>"}},"text_t9Y49p":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Can the wallpaper be removed without damaging the wall?","content":"<p>It depends on the material. Peel & Stick wallpapers can be removed cleanly without damage, making them perfect for renters or temporary spaces. Pre-Pasted and Type II wallpapers are more permanent solutions, designed for long-term installations.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["text_4bxz7Y","text_dhMf9q","text_YzitRa","text_J97hME","text_t9Y49p"],"name":"Accordion group","settings":{"title":"","title_align":"text-left","title_size":4,"heading_size":5,"text_size":5,"text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"section_icons_EMgfAg":{"type":"section-icons","blocks":{"icon_block_7FHcpc":{"type":"icon_block","settings":{"icon_name":"icon-basket-return","icon_alt":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MADE_IN_USA_ICON_671945e4-7c1e-4fb3-9e4c-af59352c364d.png","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"Made In The USA","text":"<p>Every wallpaper and mural is printed in the USA by experienced artists and print specialists, ensuring consistent quality, careful craftsmanship, and reliable production from start to finish.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}},"icon_block_jg4GgM":{"type":"icon_block","settings":{"icon_name":"icon-shipment-world","icon_alt":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/LEED_ICON_4cb08f1b-439c-495d-a759-341fac036804.png","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"Eco-Certified Materials","text":"<p>Printed using LEED Platinum–compliant materials and inks, our wallpapers and murals support eco-certified interiors for commercial, hospitality, healthcare, and residential environments.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}},"icon_block_4pHaTG":{"type":"icon_block","settings":{"icon_name":"icon-phone","icon_alt":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PRECISION_ICON_4d1a006c-9113-4383-8329-8363ed5bba6a.png","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"Perfect Fit Every Time","text":"<p>Each wallpaper and mural is printed to your exact wall dimensions, eliminating waste, trimming, and guesswork—just a precise, made-to-measure fit every time.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}}},"block_order":["icon_block_7FHcpc","icon_block_jg4GgM","icon_block_4pHaTG"],"name":"Icon columns","settings":{"title":"","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","icons_size":100,"icon_alignment":"icon--top","layout":"grid--stacked","align_text":"text-center","width":"wrapper","padding_top":80,"padding_bottom":80}},"section_hero_n6yfYA":{"type":"section-hero","blocks":{"text_d4TB8m":{"type":"text","settings":{"richtext":"<h3>Custom Commercial Wallpaper & Large Format Wall Murals<\/h3>","text_size":8}},"text_k3GBFq":{"type":"text","settings":{"richtext":"<p>Applied Coverings produces custom commercial wallpaper and large format wall murals printed to exact specifications. Our solutions are designed for high traffic commercial environments, with durable materials, precise color control, and made-to-measure production for large walls and feature installations.<\/p><p>We collaborate with architects, designers, and project managers to deliver reliable printing, material guidance, and project ready wallcoverings supporting commercial interiors from concept through completion.<\/p>","text_size":5}},"button_twA3KJ":{"type":"button","settings":{"link_text_1":"Request Commercial Quote","link_1":"shopify:\/\/pages\/upload-your-own-image-custom-wallpaper","button_size_1":"btn--long","button_style_1":"btn--outline","button_color_1":"btn--white","link_text_2":"","link_2":"","button_size_2":"btn--long","button_style_2":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_2":"btn--white","link_text_3":"","link_3":"","button_size_3":"btn--long","button_style_3":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_3":"btn--white"}}},"block_order":["text_d4TB8m","text_k3GBFq","button_twA3KJ"],"name":"Image banner","settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_fifth","overlay_opacity":100,"overlay_color":"#375a5e","enable_overlay_text":false,"preload_image":false,"content_width":2000,"text_align":"align--bottom-center","text_color":"text--white","color_bg":"hero__content--transparent","width":"wrapper--none","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}}},"order":["hero","main","section_richtext_EyLEHM","section_double_GrFhey","section_pair_slideshow_accordion_GTDX3L","section_pair_slideshow_accordion_MMQahj","section_pair_slideshow_accordion_iNCC9m","section_pair_slideshow_accordion_8iAGmW","section_pair_slideshow_accordion_gtNgdw","section_text_spotlight_8B7cRd","section_faq_qY6NpW","section_icons_EMgfAg","section_hero_n6yfYA"]}